Z||000000||Jay||08-24-2001||04:43 PM||||Toronto's GTA show is set for September 15th 2001.  For a printable entry form and detailed map of location and other details goto <A HREF="http://www.members.home.net/gtaclub" TARGET=_blank>www.members.home.net/gtaclub</A> <P>Snap On Tools will be there with givaways.  So will Steve's Tire, Stereo Dimension, Race-Tech, and many many more...!!!<P>Everything from Northstars, 3800 SC,2.8 Turbos, Vortec's, 4.3, 350's,  and kit cars to daily drivers and works in progress.  Look forward to meeting some new faces.  If you see me come over and say hi! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cayuga3_3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Jay||08-24-2001||06:43 PM||||Forgot to mention.  The day after the show everyone is going to Cayuga International Dragway for 1/4 mile shoot out!!!Bring your car along to race another Fiero!!!||||reg||1
